---
---

<section id="about" class="about section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">About Me</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Architecting Digital Solutions With <span class="text-gradient">Clean Code</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        A look into my academic foundation, agile development mindset, and passion for software engineering.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Bio Narrative -->
      <div class="about-narrative glass-card">
        <h3 class="narrative-title">My Journey</h3>
        <p class="narrative-text">
          I am a Full Stack Developer currently pursuing my <strong>Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</strong> at the <em>Supreme Institute of Management and Technology</em> in Mankundu, West Bengal (Expected July 2027).
        </p>
        <p class="narrative-text">
          My professional journey began with hands-on enterprise software development at <strong>Koushiki Software</strong>, where I spearheaded the creation of scalable web applications using <strong>ASP.NET Core</strong> and <strong>React.js</strong>. I thrive on solving complex backend data grid challenges, designing RESTful APIs, and implementing secure role-based access control (RBAC).
        </p>
        <p class="narrative-text">
          Whether collaborating in daily Agile stand-ups or debugging complex database workflows across SQL Server and SQLite, I am dedicated to delivering high-performance, maintainable code that creates real business value.
        </p>

        <div class="bio-highlights">
          <div class="highlight-pill">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pill-icon"><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path d="m17 5-5-3-5 3"></path><path d="m17 19-5 3-5-3"></path></svg>
            Quick Learner
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-pill">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pill-icon"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
            Team Collaboration
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-pill">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pill-icon"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
            Problem Solving
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-pill">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pill-icon"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
            Clean Code Practices
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Info / Achievements Cards -->
      <div class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="info-card glass-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h4>Education</h4>
            <p class="school">Supreme Institute of Management & Technology</p>
            <p class="degree">Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)</p>
            <span class="year-badge code-font">Expected July 2027</span>
          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="info-card glass-card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h4>Language Proficiency</h4>
            <p class="school">Multilingual Communication</p>
            <div class="lang-tags code-font">
              <span>English</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>Hindi</span>
              <span>•</span>
              <span>Bengali</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-narrative {
    padding: 2.5rem;
  }

  .narrative-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .narrative-text {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .narrative-text strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .narrative-text em {
    color: var(--text-accent);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .bio-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .highlight-pill {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .highlight-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-primary);
    color: var(--text-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Sidebar Cards */
  .about-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .info-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.8rem;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-content h4 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .school {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .degree {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .year-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);
    color: var(--text-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .year-badge {
    background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .lang-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 968px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
